### 7.2 Design Rationale

The system is sized to achieve:
- ≤ 5% unmet demand target (achieved: {{ sizing.unmet_demand_pct }}%)
- {{ sizing.autonomy_hours }}-hour evening autonomy
- Balanced curtailment ({{ sizing.curtailment_pct }}%)

{% if demand %}
The PV array is sized at {{ (sizing.pv_capacity_kwp / demand.peak_load_kw) | num(1) }}x the peak demand of {{ demand.peak_load_kw | num(1) }} kW, reflecting the need to charge batteries during daylight hours for evening dispatch.
{% endif %}

